<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-QBE ups ConsRutile stake.</title>
<headline>RTRS-QBE ups ConsRutile stake.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>QBE Insurance Group Ltd said on Wednesday that it increased its stake in Consolidated Rutile Ltd to 13.26 percent from 7.31 percent.</p>
<p>QBE said in a substantial shareholder notice to the Australian Stock Exchange that it now held 7.92 million shares in Consolidated Rutile, compared with 4.36 million previously.</p>
<p>Consolidated Rutile is 50 percent owned by Cudgen RZ Ltd, which in turn is controlled by RGC Ltd.</p>
<p>Consolidated Rutile shares closed steady at A$2.26.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
